  "description": "Generate identifiers, conforming to the Guid CLR type, that are based on a prefix and sequence. The identifiers are not compliant with RFC4122 (and are marked with a version outside of what is defined in RFC4122, as to guarantee never colliding with an actually compliant UUID, such as one generated using Guid.NewGuid).",
